    "source": "Current monthly_model_scope70 frozen id3. Frozen target_definition70 TRAIN_INPUTS dates/ends/offsets/plain10/common_good/all4targets and cached centered log_excess unchanged. Flatten historical security identities from original producer META.training.symbols with exact offset/date/end validation, query identities from original scope META. Original source model independently replayed; raw atol1e-12/rtol0/equalnan, availability and rank exact.",
    "global_model": "Annual prior-Dec31 cutoff, historical signal date strictly after cutoff-5y and labelend<=cutoff; original common4target finite/10feature cohort and minimum2rows/month. Same prior5y, month-balanced12month decay normalized to rowcount, training-only weighted scaler, alpha10 and min18months. No relabel/recenter/added features. Recompute source raw log prediction for every original eligible query; source availability must exactly match cache.",
    "local_cohort": "For each query use only same exact security ID in its mature annual global training cohort. Minimum18 distinct same-security signal months; otherwise both arms retain source pooled raw exactly. Query/current eligibility does not depend on own history or future label. No positive rebound gate, no ad hoc aliases/ticker bonus, no training history outside historical archived pool.",
    "weights": "Both arms same own rows and weights: w=2^(-calendar_month_age(signal,annual_cutoff)/12) * exp(-mean((X_h-X_query)^2)/(2*0.5^2)). X are unchanged bounded centered percentile plain10. No local weight normalization. Pooled annual training scaler s (same floor) used ONLY for d=(X_h-X_query)/s, not kernel. Own recency anchored cutoff not query date; query-local weights may change each month, global fit/cohort remain annually frozen.",
    "residual": "r_h=cached log_excess_h-pooled_fit(X_h). In-sample residual inside already matured prior annual training set, not OOF and not future data. Retain pooled current raw prediction; no residual trading or market-neutral claim.",
    "constant": "a0=sum(w*r)/(sum(w)+12). raw=pooled_query+a0. Prior12 represents12 unit-weight pseudo-observations with zero residual.",
    "linear": "Z=[1,d]. Solve (Z.T W Z+diag(12,10 repeated10))theta=Z.T W r. Query d=0, so raw=pooled_query+theta[0]. Penalize both intercept and slope toward zero residual; positive penalties ensure unique solution. Same rows/weights as local_constant. No coefficient clipping or search. If d allzero, linear and constant must coincide within1e-12.",
    "numeric": "Finite-check all used fits/scalers/weights/residuals/predictions; unexpected nonfinite or solve failures abort, never silently drop used rows or replace failed local fit. Available source raw plus no own history returns exact source. All-zero residual, coldstart or zero local weights yield exact source (do not add floating zero). Prefix/future-poison tests; actual chosen models use only labels matured by annual cutoff.",
    "ranking": "Use original U=forecast_available & eligible at every query, not only weak/calm months. Both complete local raw vectors ranked independently using exact original eligible_rank over U. Outside U retain original rank. Any missing new forecast inside U => both arms whole-month original rank and audit, never shrink U. If every raw in U exactly equals original source raw, reuse original cached rank bitwise. No query beta or new gate.",
    "placement": "Only replace25% of existing MLslot. delta=.25*(.05*weak_narrow + .01*calm10&notweak&extension_available)*(newrank-oldlogrank), on original forecast_available&eligible cells. No new budget; original50/52core, skip42, calm residual, all other state/support/effects unchanged. True ep selector takes modified pretop2 andranks3..5/gap.02 with original baseline/core/coreweight payload. No final global rerank.",
    "execution": "Original archivedTop32proxy+theme17/122periods, original warmup/positive skipped-momentum eligibility,3equal/2half/<2cash,longonly,no leverage,month-fixed adjusted units/no intramonth. Same complete-close signal andfill zero cost idealization; same orders nextopenzero and5bp per side replay separately.",
    "selection": "5fixed configs. First88, early53/recent35. TrainCAGR>=current67control-1e-12, Sharpe>=control-.05, maxDD>=control-.03, early/recentCAGR>=control-.025. Highest admissible trainingCAGR with1e-12 lowerid tie, defaultid2. Freeze both diagnostics beforelater34. All fixed arms reported evenfailed; no later34 reselection.",
    "validation": "Root synthetics + independent review before initialize; source exactparity, original3controls score/order exact, modeltiming/prefix/identity/kernel/scaler/funding/selector/fixed-unit independentreplay, matchedpair attribution, input/code/cache/raw64 hashes and end21436protected audit. No old source or monitor/account edits.",
    "novelty": "Prior company_context/zero used kernel localconstant label means, not locally linear correction to pooled logRidge residual with matchedconstant same weights. Small25% existingmodel slot deliberately limits newmechanism; not a claim whollynew statistical method. All history repeatedlyresearched, not cleanOOS."
  },
